# HackTool - SharpUp PrivEsc Tool Execution | T1569.002, T1574.005, T1615 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_hktl_sharpup.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\SharpUp.exe" OR Description="SharpUp" OR CommandLine IN ("*HijackablePaths*", "*UnquotedServicePath*", "*ProcessDLLHijack*", "*ModifiableServiceBinaries*", "*ModifiableScheduledTask*", "*DomainGPPPassword*", "*CachedGPPPassword*"))
